    "body": "I'm on a Mac using the XCode 16.2 supplied compiler.\r\n\r\nConfiguring with \r\n```\r\n./config --banner=Configured --debug enable-demos enable-h3demo enable-asan enable-ubsan enable-rc5 enable-md2 enable-ec_nistp_64_gcc_128 enable-fips && perl configdata.pm --dump\r\n```\r\nRunning `make test`\r\n```\r\n\"/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/usr/bin/make\" run_tests\r\n( SRCTOP=. \\\r\n          BLDTOP=. \\\r\n          PERL=\"/usr/local/Cellar/perl/5.40.0/bin/perl\" \\\r\n          FIPSKEY=\"f4556650ac31d35461610bac4ed81b1a181b2d8a43ea2854cbae22ca74560813\" \\\r\n          EXE_EXT= \\\r\n          /usr/local/Cellar/perl/5.40.0/bin/perl ./test/run_tests.pl  )\r\n00-prep_fipsmodule_cnf.t .. \r\ncrypto/stack/stack.c:439:13: runtime error: call to function pd_free through pointer to incorrect function type 'void (*)(void *)'\r\nproperty_parse.c:301: note: pd_free defined here\r\nSUMMARY: UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer: undefined-behavior crypto/stack/stack.c:439:13 in \r\n../../util/wrap.pl ../../apps/openssl fipsinstall -pedantic -module ../../providers/fips.dylib -provider_name fips -section_name fips_sect -out ../../test/fipsmodule.cnf => 134\r\nnot ok 1 - fips install\r\n00-prep_fipsmodule_cnf.t .. 1/? ------------------------------------------------\r\n#   Failed test 'fips install'\r\n#   at test/recipes/00-prep_fipsmodule_cnf.t line 33.\r\n00-prep_fipsmodule_cnf.t .. Dubious, test returned 1 (wstat 256, 0x100)\r\nFailed 1/1 subtests \r\n\r\nTest Summary Report\r\n-------------------\r\n00-prep_fipsmodule_cnf.t (Wstat: 256 (exited 1) Tests: 1 Failed: 1)\r\n  Failed test:  1\r\n  Non-zero exit status: 1\r\nFiles=1, Tests=1,  5 wallclock secs ( 0.01 usr  0.00 sys +  0.28 cusr  0.12 csys =  0.41 CPU)\r\nResult: FAIL\r\nmake[2]: *** [run_tests] Error 1\r\nmake[1]: *** [_tests] Error 2\r\nmake: *** [tests] Error 2\r\n```\r\n\r\nI don't know if it is a false positive?",
